### Illustrative HTTP requests — placeholders. Never send against production without authorization.
@base=https://api.example.invalid
@projectId=11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@draftId=22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@runId=44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
@token=REPLACE_WITH_TEST_TOKEN

### Create project (server atomically assigns creator Owner)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-project-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Coffee Shop","description":"Simulated cafe ordering design","category":"Food & Beverage","designTargets":["web","mobile"]}

### Retrieve current draft (copy response ETag)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save Builder Step 01 using opaque ETag returned above
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/builder/steps/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_ETAG"
Content-Type: application/json

{"stepNo":1,"status":"in-progress","payload":{"prefillSource":"project","projectName":"Coffee Shop"}}

### Owner confirms an AI candidate; Editor cannot confirm authoritatively
POST {{base}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/candidate-claims/30303030-3030-4030-8030-303030303030/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_ETAG"
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"confirm","expectedDraftVersion":3}

### Run exact draft validation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/validation-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-validation-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"draftId":"{{draftId}}","expectedDraftVersion":3}

### Approve (requires DIFFERENT authorized Approver for materially edited draft, no blockers)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-approve-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"draftId":"{{draftId}}","expectedDraftVersion":3,"validationRunId":"{{runId}}","expectedDraftSha256":"REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_HASH"}
